      "sensing": {
        "about": "Default sensor fits (RK14, Atomic Rockets plan section 17.2 point 2): every craft gets a passive set for free, by tech and size, so fog of war works with no setup. A fit is a list of instruments whose aperture grows with the hull (a share of its length, between a floor and a cap). Authored stand-ins, modelled on flown instruments; a pack or the GM fits better ones.",
        "default_fits": [
          {
            "tech": "today",
            "note": "Instruments of the kind flown now: a visible camera (Rosetta OSIRIS-class), a cooled mid-infrared telescope (WISE-class), a soft X-ray monitor and a radio receiver. The two telescopes look out through the zodiacal light at 1 au.",
            "sources": [
